    "summary": "Portrait of a young woman; single-page painting mounted on album folio. A young woman stands, holding two bunches of pink roses. She wears a green flowered blouse, an open red and white striped jacket and a saffron yellow skirt. Her jewel and feather head ornament is attached to a red and white striped cap from which a dark purple veil falls. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes.\r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
